Subject: [PATCH 447/488] [DS4.1] CED routing mask and the drafter's packed
 slots in TileLang

Each is one launch at the CED indices: the decoder's MoE routing mask
(a valid index whose row is not padding) and the drafter's context slots
(PAD_SLOT_ID at an invalid index), where torch compared, negated and
masked around a TileLang gather.
